+/**
+ * @fileoverview
+ * 'settings-bangs-page' is the Bangs page (chrome://settings/bangs), a
+ * subpage of the General page's search engine card. It has three lists:
+ * the user's own bangs, the downloaded bangs list (the first 100 that match
+ * the search field), and the downloaded bangs the user deleted, which can be
+ * restored. The browser does the matching, so the page never holds the whole
+ * downloaded list. It asks for nothing until it's opened, and lets go of the
+ * lists when it closes.
+ */
